---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Pusat Data — ClimateOn"
description: "Pemantauan kondisi iklim Indonesia secara berkala. ENSO, gelombang panas laut, siklon tropis, suhu muka laut, dan anomali curah hujan."
permalink: /pusat-data/
---

<section class="kategori-header datahub-landing-header">
    <div class="container">
        {% include "components/breadcrumb.njk" %}
        <br>
        <h1>Pusat Data</h1>
        <p class="kategori-desc">Pemantauan kondisi iklim Indonesia secara berkala berdasarkan data satelit, stasiun pengamatan, dan model iklim.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="datahub-landing-grid">
            {% for monitor in pusat-data.items %}
            <a href="{{ monitor.url }}" class="datahub-landing-card">
                <div class="datahub-landing-icon">
                    <i data-lucide="{{ monitor.ikon }}"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="datahub-landing-body">
                    <h2>{{ monitor.judul }}</h2>
                    <p>{{ monitor.deskripsi }}</p>
                    <div class="datahub-landing-status">
                        <span class="status-dot" style="background-color: {{ monitor.statusWarna }}"></span>
                        <span style="color: {{ monitor.statusWarna }}">{{ monitor.status }}</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="datahub-landing-arrow">
                    <i data-lucide="arrow-right"></i>
                </div>
            </a>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
